<title>SWITZERLAND: SBC opens Duesseldorf office.</title>
<headline>SBC opens Duesseldorf office.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp said it was opening a representative office in Duesseldorf to underscore its commitment to the German market.</p>
<p>In addition to its German banking unit in Frankfurt and Munich, SBC is represented in Berlin, Freiburg, Hamburg and Stuttgart, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
